
(7 eyinqaba?) iqiniso: { Okuphumayo bhala: ['7 is an ODD NUMBER'], umugqa-omusha. }, uma-kungenjalo: { Okuphumayo bhala: ['WRONG!']. }.
(4 elinganayo?) iqiniso: { Okuphumayo bhala: ['4 is an EVEN NUMBER'], umugqa-omusha. }, uma-kungenjalo: { Okuphumayo bhala: ['WRONG!']. }.
(5 elinganayo?) iqiniso: { Okuphumayo bhala: ['WRONG!']. }, uma-kungenjalo: { Okuphumayo bhala: ['5 is NOT AN EVEN NUMBER'], umugqa-omusha. }.
(6 eyinqaba?) iqiniso: { Okuphumayo bhala: ['WRONG!']. }, uma-kungenjalo: { Okuphumayo bhala: ['6 is NOT AN ODD NUMBER'], umugqa-omusha. }.
